<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Project Sanctuary — One Page</title>
<style>
:root{
  --sky:#1f7fd6;--sky-d:#1565b0;--sea:#19b9a6;--sea-d:#0e8f86;--sea-l:#5fd9c8;
  --ink:#0c3a4a;--teal-dk:#0c4a5c;--paper:#fff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,.16);
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,.28);--leaf:#37d98a;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html{-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact;}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#eaf8ff;}
.sheet{
  position:relative;width:210mm;min-height:297mm;margin:0 auto;overflow:hidden;
  background-image:linear-gradient(165deg,rgba(13,60,110,.78),rgba(14,143,134,.42) 52%,rgba(31,185,166,.30) 100%),url("data:image/png;base64,");
  background-size:cover;background-position:center;padding:0;
}
/* light caustics / organic blobs */
.blob{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(38px);opacity:.5;pointer-events:none;}
.b1{width:340px;height:340px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(95,217,200,.7),transparent 70%);top:-90px;right:-80px;}
.b2{width:300px;height:300px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(55,217,138,.55),transparent 70%);bottom:120px;left:-110px;}
.b3{width:220px;height:220px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,255,255,.45),transparent 70%);top:38%;right:8%;}
.wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:40px 46px 30px;}

/* top brand */
.top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:26px;}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.ccmark{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;border:2.4px solid #fff;position:relative;}
.ccmark:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:6px;bottom:6px;width:3px;height:6px;background:#fff;border-radius:1px;box-shadow:5px -4px 0 #fff,10px -8px 0 #fff,15px -12px 0 #fff;}
.brand .t{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;}.brand .t b{font-weight:800;}
.leafchip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:20px;padding:5px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;backdrop-filter:blur(8px);}
.leafchip svg{width:15px;height:15px;}
.top{gap:10px;}
.watch{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#ff3b3b;color:#fff;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border-radius:20px;padding:6px 14px;margin-left:8px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(255,59,59,.45);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);}

/* hero */
.kick{letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;color:#cdeefb;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px;}
h1{font-size:62px;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-1.5px;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 3px 22px rgba(6,38,66,.4);margin-bottom:16px;}
h1 .grad{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#adfbe0,#7fe3ff);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;}
.tagline{font-size:21px;line-height:1.4;color:#eaf8ff;max-width:560px;font-weight:500;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(6,38,66,.45);margin-bottom:24px;}

/* deadline ribbon */
.ribbon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:rgba(255,80,80,.16);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,140,140,.6);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 18px;margin-bottom:30px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px);}
.ribbon .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff6b6b;box-shadow:0 0 12px #ff6b6b;}
.ribbon b{color:#fff;font-size:15px;}.ribbon span{color:#ffd9d9;font-size:13px;}

/* three pillars */
.watchrow{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;}.watchlink{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;justify-content:center;text-decoration:none;background:#4198f2;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;border-radius:12px;padding:11px 12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(65,152,242,.45);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);letter-spacing:.2px;}.watchlink.alt{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);}
.mission{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--leaf);border-radius:10px;padding:11px 16px;margin-bottom:18px;font-size:13.5px;color:#eaf8ff;backdrop-filter:blur(8px);}.mission b{color:#fff;}.mission .mleaf{margin-right:6px;}
.pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-bottom:26px;}
.pill{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:18px;backdrop-filter:blur(10px);}
.pill .ic{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--sea-l),var(--leaf));
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:19px;}
.pill h3{font-size:16px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:5px;}
.pill p{font-size:12.5px;color:#dcf3fb;line-height:1.45;}

/* metric strip */
.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:26px;}
.metric{background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 12px;text-align:center;backdrop-filter:blur(8px);}
.metric .n{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.5px;line-height:1;}
.metric .l{font-size:10.5px;color:#cdeefb;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.3;}

/* the ask card */
.askrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-bottom:24px;}
.ask{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(31,127,214,.30),rgba(25,185,166,.30));
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:22px 24px;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);}
.ask .lbl{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#cdeefb;font-weight:700;}
.ask .big{font-size:42px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:4px 0;}
.ask .sub{font-size:13px;color:#eaf8ff;}
.proof{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:20px;backdrop-filter:blur(10px);}
.proof h4{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#cdeefb;margin-bottom:10px;}
.proof li{list-style:none;font-size:12px;color:#eaf8ff;padding:4px 0 4px 18px;position:relative;line-height:1.35;}
.proof li:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:9px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--leaf);}

/* footer */
.foot{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:16px;}
.foot .ref{font-size:11px;color:#dcf3fb;line-height:1.5;max-width:62%;}
.foot .ref b{color:#fff;}
.foot .cta{text-align:right;}
.foot .cta .big{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;}
.foot .cta .small{font-size:10.5px;color:#cdeefb;margin-top:3px;}
.eco{color:#aef0c6;font-weight:700;}
@media print{.sheet{margin:0;}}
</style></head><body>
<div class="sheet">
  <div class="blob b1"></div><div class="blob b2"></div><div class="blob b3"></div>
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="top">
      <div class="brand"><svg width='30' height='30'
   xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"
   xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#"
   xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
   xmlns:svg="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
   xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
   xmlns:sodipodi="http://sodipodi.sourceforge.net/DTD/sodipodi-0.dtd"
   xmlns:inkscape="http://www.inkscape.org/namespaces/inkscape"
   id="Ebene_1"
   data-name="Ebene 1"
   viewBox="0 0 113.39 113.39"
   version="1.1"
   sodipodi:docname="CC_Logo_Master.svg"
   inkscape:version="0.92.2 5c3e80d, 2017-08-06"><defs
     id="defs4"><style
       id="style2">.cls-1{fill:#ffffff;}</style></defs><title
     id="title6">2018-10-22_Cerulean_Circle_GmbH_Logo</title><path
     class="cls-1"
     d="M63.78,12.59A51.19,51.19,0,1,1,12.59,63.78,51.24,51.24,0,0,1,63.78,12.59m0-5.5a56.69,56.69,0,1,0,56.69,56.69A56.69,56.69,0,0,0,63.78,7.09Z"
     transform="translate(-7.09 -7.09)"
     id="path8" /><rect
     class="cls-1"
     x="24.65"
     y="70.46"
     width="8.22"
     height="8.5"
     id="rect10" /><rect
     class="cls-1"
     x="36.34"
     y="63.68"
     width="8.22"
     height="15.28"
     id="rect12" /><rect
     class="cls-1"
     x="48.04"
     y="53.9"
     width="8.22"
     height="25.06"
     id="rect14" /><rect
     class="cls-1"
     x="59.73"
     y="44.21"
     width="8.22"
     height="34.75"
     id="rect16" /><rect
     class="cls-1"
     x="71.42"
     y="34.42"
     width="8.22"
     height="44.54"
     id="rect18" /></svg><span class="t">Cerulean&nbsp;<b>Circle</b></span></div>
      <div class="leafchip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 21C5 18 3 11 4 4c7-1 14 1 16 8-3-2-7-2-10 1 4-1 7 1 8 4-2 1-4 2-6 3z" fill="#aef0c6"/></svg><span>powered by Ecoverse</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="kick">Confidential · Investment Opportunity</div>
    <h1>Save a world<br>before it's <span class="grad">deleted.</span></h1>
    <div class="tagline">We <b>save the open‑metaverse community</b> and <b>secure their IP assets</b> — the first home where digital‑art owners hold permanent, self‑sovereign title to their work.</div>

    <div class="ribbon"><span class="dot"></span><b>27 July 2026</b><span>— Spatial deletes unmigrated creator worlds. The window is now.</span></div>

    <div class="watchrow"><a class="watchlink" href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/2WSNNF9qDhw" target="_blank" rel="noopener">▶ The 30‑second film</a><a class="watchlink alt" href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/m8vwpB70v5A" target="_blank" rel="noopener">▶ Tyler Hobbs · Apple Vision Pro</a><a class="watchlink alt" href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/InfL8sWrsQw" target="_blank" rel="noopener">▶ Davos 2024 space</a></div>
    <div class="mission"><span class="mleaf">🌿</span><b>Mission:</b>&nbsp;rescue the open‑metaverse community before the shutdown — and secure every creator’s IP, forever.</div>
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pill"><div class="ic">🌊</div><h3>Migrate</h3><p>Opt‑in rescue of creators' composed 3D worlds onto the web‑native Ecoverse runtime — before they vanish.</p></div>
      <div class="pill"><div class="ic">🔑</div><h3>Protect</h3><p>Every owner gets a <b>Web4ID</b> — cryptographic, portable title to their IP that no platform can ever erase.</p></div>
      <div class="pill"><div class="ic">🌿</div><h3>Belong</h3><p>A curated, identity‑protected digital‑art community with a living home — not a one‑time backup.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="metrics">
      <div class="metric"><a href="https://www.spatial.io/categories/best-of-spatial" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;"><div class="n">3M+</div><div class="l">Spaces on Spatial*</div></a></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="n">~100</div><div class="l">Concurrent users demonstrated</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="n">$10–50</div><div class="l">Effective cost / engaged user</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="n">15 mo</div><div class="l">Window + runway</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="askrow">
      <div class="ask">
        <div class="lbl">The Round</div>
        <div class="big">$5M <span style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;">for 10%</span></div>
        <div class="sub">A new, dedicated entity · backed by <b>Cerulean Circle GmbH</b> · powered by <span class="eco">🌿 Ecoverse</span>. $50M post‑money (proposed, subject to negotiation).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="proof">
        <h4>Why we can do it</h4>
        <li><a href="https://ecoverse.com/space/qql/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#eaf8ff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(174,240,198,.6);">Pace Gallery × Tyler Hobbs metaverse, delivered</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://ow2con19.sched.com/event/NztK/web-40-objects-in-the-browser-finally-here-now" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#eaf8ff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(174,240,198,.6);">Web4x / WODA — presented OW2con Paris 2019</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mdonges/recent-activity/all/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#eaf8ff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(174,240,198,.6);">Web4ID</a> identity (<a href="https://dal-identity.com/web-4-0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#eaf8ff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(174,240,198,.6);">DAL</a> · <a href="https://www.tenbeo.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#eaf8ff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(174,240,198,.6);">tenbeo</a>)</li>
        <li><a href="https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/ip_23_3718" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#eaf8ff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(174,240,198,.6);">Aligned with EU's Web 4.0 strategy</a></li>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="foot">
      <div class="ref"><b>This is a one‑page summary.</b> Every figure and claim here is detailed, sourced and evidence‑labeled in the full <a href="https://test.wo-da.de/EAMD.ucp/Components/com/ceruleanCircle/EAM/5_ux/ProjectSanctuary/Project_Sanctuary_Prospectus.html" style="color:#fff;" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>Project Sanctuary Investment Prospectus</b></a> — including conservative/base/upside conversion modeling, use of funds, risks, and a diligence evidence list. *3M+ reflects cumulative spaces created, not active users; the model is built on the active base. Not an offer of securities.</div>
      <div class="cta"><a class="big" href="https://test.wo-da.de/EAMD.ucp/Components/com/ceruleanCircle/EAM/5_ux/ProjectSanctuary/Project_Sanctuary_Prospectus.html" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:2px solid #aef0c6;padding-bottom:2px;" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the full prospectus →</a><div class="small">▶ Films: the 30s film · Tyler Hobbs (Apple Vision Pro) · Davos 2024 space · ecoverse.com/space/qql</div></div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
</body></html>